  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is purely imaginary.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>Geometrically, the locus of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;is the circle with end points of diameter is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and centre is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.So the nearest&nbsp;point to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on the circle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a35641e8-1e2b-43ec-88b0-28240d321060-image.png\" style=\"width: 347px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>Minimum distance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
